WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:04.270
I proclaimed war, and 
Millefi accepted...

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:08.020
It's just another battle, no problem...

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.780
I will protect them to the end.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.840
Our countries, our people 
and your futures...

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:19.450
Let's go Grand Vert... 
Lend me your power!

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.610
Leo-sama, I apologize...

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:03.120
Battle of Grana Fortress

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.040
Viollette and the Royal Warriors...

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:06.140
...they failed in their mission...

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:11.340
They've been captured 
at Cerese Fortress...

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:15.190
I see... what about Gaul?

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.680
He has followed your orders

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.070
and is heading to
Cerese Fortress with

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.500
General Godwin and Genoise.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.890
But Prince Gaul...

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:29.000
he doesn't have his 
heart in this battle...

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.110
It doesn't matter...

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.510
All he needs to do is show off

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.960
and show all the people 
and soldiers a good time.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.630
I will... win it on my own.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.390
This battle isn't honorable.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.730
The orders are to attack the fortress,

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.650
Of course!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.650
Godwin, I'm sorry about this.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.650
I know this is something 
you wouldn't like to do.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:03.230
I have nothing to complain 
about as long as

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.920
I am riding alongside 
you, your Excellency.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:06.870
Is that so.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.990
Gaul-sama, according to the 
report from the vanguard,

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.690
Princess Millefiore is 
not in Cerese Fortress.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:18.260
Oh! Then I can attack the 
fortress without reserve.

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.030
I don't want people to say

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:26.760
Let's show off a bit and 
give it a little effort!

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:28.220
Yeah!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.400
I'm reporting from Chapal Lake District!

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.590
Battle of thirty thousand soldiers is

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.150
getting more and more interesting!

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:43.350
The battlefield points are 5100 to 4900

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.620
But it's still too early to 
tell which side is winning!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.680
Here at the route to 
Grana Floating Fortress!

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.080
The second troop of Biscotti warriors

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.380
have just come in sight 
of the floating fortress!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.160
The light armor troops 
are true to their name,

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.510
and advancing at an amazing speed!

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:12.930
The main camp is right 
across this bridge!

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.940
Yeah! Charge!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.700
Shunko Renten hou!

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.580
This is impossible!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.720
Let's retreat! Retreat!

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:44.800
Huh?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:46.840
Countess Dalkian!

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.600
I have a message from the Head Knight!

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:51.890
Yes.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.960
The third troop with

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:57.190
Countess Dalkian and Chief
Panettone are requested

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.020
to reinforce the leading second troop!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.190
Hmm, understood!

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:05.550
The enemy line is spread thin...

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.990
Yukikaze! Third Troop of Biscotti!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:14.990
We'll cut through the enemy

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.840
and go to reinforce the second troop!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.870
What's this?
There's a change in battle situaion.

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:21.800
Countess Dalkian and
her third troop

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.300
are now on the offensive!

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:26.200
Are they headed for her 
highness Leo-sama's main camp

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.540
or going to reinforce the second troop?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.300
Oh, but wait!

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:37.390
Hold on, Countess Dalkian!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.190
It's been a while, General Bernard!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:42.650
Yes, it has.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:46.650
I'm sorry but I can't allow you to pass.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:51.780
Really?
Is that a challenge to a duel?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.660
I would be much obliged, 
if you don't mind...

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.470
Wait a minute!

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.760
Bernard! I'll be your opponent!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.010
Rolan!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.510
Count Martinozzi...

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.740
Hey! What's happing now?

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:12.930
Is this going to be a fight 
between the commanders?

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:16.180
A fight between the 
generals of both armies!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.360
Sorry, but I'll take it from here.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:24.940
Hmm. Understood!

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.020
Third troop! Let's go!

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:30.840
Well, well...

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:34.200
how long has it been 
since our last duel...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:39.000
It's the first time since we 
became heads of the knights.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.750
So it's been more than three years...

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:45.100
Both knights were born 
into knight families!

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.930
And they are such close 
friends that they

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.550
send each other seasonal 
gifts personally.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:55.890
They both ride celkuls 
that are thoroughbreds!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.940
And they both wield spears and shields!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:02.310
Now let's see the duel between 
the heads of knights!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:14.160
The duel has started!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.330
Reporting from Cerese Fortress!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.150
That's right!

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.130
His Excellency Prince Gaul
and his Imperial Guard

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:22.040
have launched a massive attack!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.720
Souga Souken!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.610
Archers!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.110
Shoot!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:57.470
Tap.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.950
The right flank's defense has 
been completely destroyed...

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.920
Right!

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.930
They may be outnumbered but 
that's not stopping them!

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.790
The Biscotti gatekeepers 
are being blown away

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:24.020
like leaves or petals!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.070
What do you think, Chief?
Can you make it?

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.190
Yes!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:41.250
There's a tailwind so I should 
be able to fly right up!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:47.000
Harlan, let's go together 
to the Princess!

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:51.230
Flying steed Harlan

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.720
Taking off!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.610
We won't let you go!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.820
Oh! That's dangerous!

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.620
One, two!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:19.910
Three!

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:35.090
What?

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.110
Yeah!

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:39.970
Captain Veil! Watch out!

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:40.800
Huh?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.200
Whaat?!

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.620
Genoise Archer Unit defeated!

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.580
Chief, your noble sacrifice 
was not in vain!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.510
Oh, oh... you saved me, Harlan!

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:25.270
Okay, now let's hurry to 
the Princess and our Hero!

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:27.100
But before that,

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.940
I need to find some 
clothes and equipment!

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:34.360
Hey! I'm here in front of 
the Grana Floating Fortress!

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.460
The second troop of Biscotti has reached

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:39.860
fighting distance
of the gatekeepers of the fortress!

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.340
Her highness Leo-sama's 
strategy was to place the

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:46.370
Special Armed Forces here 
to protect the main camp!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.540
Special Armed Forces?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.870
Princess, come in the middle...

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:52.500
Yes!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:55.630
The first shells will be coming!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.230
Formation against cannon fire!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.560
Spread out and advance!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:03.760
Artillery!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.770
Gunners! Aim!

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:11.320
Guns? Cannon?

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:12.700
Hero!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.660
The seal technique I 
taught you the other day!

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.030
Which one do you mean?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:24.370
The shield!
You defend! I'll attack!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.950
Okay, got it!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.080
Defender!

00:11:31.240 --> 00:11:32.500
Fire!

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.550
Artillery! Shoot the Hero!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:43.760
Roger!

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:47.970
Fire!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.120
Huh?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:09.660
Hero Sink, he's deflected 
a chaser cannon!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:11.960
What do you think, Eclair?

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:14.470
Show off!

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:16.960
But not bad!

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:24.800
Senku!

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:29.100
Futae Ichimonji!

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.050
Knights! Clean up the 
remaining opponents!

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.290
Wow, that was amazing!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:49.050
Hero Sink and the Captain 
of the Imperial Guard have

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:53.620
Looks like they are going 
to infiltrate the fortress!

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.130
Is the weather changing?

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.500
Clouds are forming in 
the sky to the east!

00:13:24.650 --> 00:13:26.910
The skies are so cloudy 
I can't see the stars...

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:28.760
NBut I still see this horrible vision...

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:32.450
Is it the battle stage of the fortress?

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:42.170
Don't cry... please 
don't cry, Millefi...

00:13:42.960 --> 00:13:45.740
I won't allow anything
that will

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.800
cause you any sadness or pain...

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:23.420
Oyakata-sama!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.010
Ah, Konoha.
Is it in the direction of the fortress?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.800
Um, Countess Dalkian, Chief Panettone...

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:37.430
Uh, it, it's like an alarm 
alerting us of danger.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.890
Soldiers from the general population

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:42.730
may not be able to enjoy the battle...

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.880
...so we will go ahead 
and remove the threat.

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.060
You lead and guide the troops!

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:49.820
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:56.200
This reaction... it must 
be a large presence...

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.030
The demons that threaten 
the land of Flonya...

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.110
There were times they

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:04.450
would burn an entire 
nation to the ground...

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.270
They even kill gods... 
those evil beings...

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:34.580
I've been waiting for you.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.160
It's the Hero and droopy ears, right?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.250
I am at the top of this fortress,

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.800
As a reward for getting this far,

00:15:57.680 --> 00:16:01.210
The Grand Vert and the 
Exmachina are both here.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:03.280
If you can take them from me,

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.770
Of course,

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:11.140
you won't be enough of 
an opponent on your own.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.260
I don't mind fighting you both at once,

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:15.370
so come and get me 
together if you'd like.

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.790
I will defeat you both, 
get the Palladion

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:23.500
and then I will go to destroy 
all of Millefi's troops.

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:27.380
Well, what are you waiting for?

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.930
Leo-sama...

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.050
Don't worry...

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:43.040
All we have to do is wait 
and the clueless Hero

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:45.650
and droopy ears will 
bring Palladion to me...

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:49.070
That might just be enough 
to change the stars...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.860
Yes, ma'am.

00:16:56.950 --> 00:17:00.590
Still, it's a forbidding sky
for the day of

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.290
our country's big battle...

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:16.300
Excuse me, your highness, 
Leonmitchelli...

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:24.270
If you are putting your treasured sword
at stake for this battle...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.250
I felt I should come here

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.520
with my treasured sword in hand...

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:32.530
Excuse me for coming here uninvited.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:38.660
It can't be... why... why?

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.910
Your highness, Leonmitchelli?
Please tell me...

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:45.990
...what is the true reason 
for this battle...

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.550
Rouge?! I am speaking with Leo-sama!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.760
You can scold me later!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:03.310
I don't have time to explain right now!

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:09.000
If I can take that from her...

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.920
If you need our treasured sword,

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:35.860
just tell me why and I 
will let you use it...

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:44.140
Why won't Leo-sama tell 
me what's going on?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:51.190
We used to be so close...

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.410
You had always been so kind to me...

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.270
...but the whole recent battles!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:06.250
Why do you hate me so much now?

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:08.660
I...

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.350
Calm down, Hero! It's unseemly!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:25.890
Like you can talk, Eclair! Your tail...

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.680
Sh, shut up!

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:32.200
The Princess said she 
would go up there alone...

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:37.300
But, I don't know,

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.030
I have this really bad feeling...

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.400
It doesn't matter...

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.800
we can't move the elevator 
from down here, can we?

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.040
I have already tried, but it's locked...

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:48.620
Eclair!

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:50.830
Come here!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:56.210
It looks like we can get up from here...

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.130
I guess so.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:01.100
But Hero, the Princess said...

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:04.090
All the Princess said was...

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.560
Let me go up alone from here...

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:18.270
So it's okay if we go up from here!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:19.820
Are you a child?

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.360
If you want to complain 
you can stay here.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.830
Who said I wasn't going?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:33.190
<i>To all participants of 
the attack and defense</i>

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:35.970
<i>
of Grana floating fortress.</i>

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.460
<i>Due to the thunderclouds,</i>

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:42.410
<i>
the flonya power of the area is slightly weaker.</i>

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:45.490
<i>Also, there is a risk of 
being hit by lightning.</i>

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:49.490
<i>
Please cease your fighting for the time being.</i>

00:20:49.490 --> 00:20:51.020
<i>I repeat,</i>

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.970
<i>cease all fighting and seek 
shelter someplace safe.</i>

00:20:55.460 --> 00:20:58.020
Both of you,
please come with me

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.500
and get under the roof...

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:12.710
Eclair!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:13.830
Yeah!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:20.460
Millefi!

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.090
Leo-sama!

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.700
Leo-sama, Princess Millefi...!

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:32.420
What is this?

00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.760
It looks like the Grana 
fortress's famous

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.600
floating battle stage is rising?!

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:38.560
Hey! Huh?! Look!

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.500
Huh?!

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:33.820
Hey, Hero?!

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:34.860
Banard, let's go!

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:35.870
OK, Rolan!

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:40.190
<b>Hero, Princess, and a Ray of Hope</b>

00:23:35.870 --> 00:23:37.770
Everybody's doing their best!

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:39.530
Please tune in again next time!
